      {
        "time": 0.2,
        "duration": 13.212917,
        "english": "The point is resolving. Rounded nose, tapering tail. No jets, no change in speed. It looks almost still in the center of my display. The distance readout tells a different story.",
        "text": "光点开始显出轮廓：圆头，逐渐收窄的尾部。没有喷口，速度也未改变。在画面中央，它看上去几乎静止。但距离读数讲的是另一回事。",
        "role": "comms"
      },
      {
        "time": 13.512917,
        "duration": 1.79925,
        "english": "On it. Checking now.",
        "text": "收到，正在检查。",
